text = "P (or Back on a gamepad) turns the free camera on and off. E switches between photo mode and spectator mode while it is off.
Flying: mouse or right stick to look, WASD or left stick to move, R and F (or D-pad up and down) to rise and sink,
Shift to go faster, mouse wheel to change the speed. Walls stop the camera in this demo."

